<     "text": "Maximise the capture on the frames that match a filter. lan is what that switch carried, lan:3 is what crossed the cable in its port 3, port:3 is that port of every switch, and vlan 10 is what was in VLAN 10. A machine or a NIC is matched wherever its frames went. With a switch or a cable in the filter, save .pcap saves only the frames shown. An agent reads them with capture_read."
